e_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae_name"}], "flags": {}, "type": "VAELoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [300, 60], "pos": [6574.0166015625, -373.0126953125], "id": 36, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.22.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [44, 1052], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae_name"}], "flags": {}, "type": "VAELoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [290, 60], "pos": [6468.4736328125, -517.1170043945312], "id": 8, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.22.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "NOISE", "links": [1109], "label": "NOISE", "type": "NOISE", "localized_name": "NOISE"}], "size": [224.30624389648438, 90], "pos": [8697, -649], "widgets_values": [42, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "noise_seed"}, "name": "noise_seed", "label": "noise_seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "noise_seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 142, "type": "RandomNoise", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.19.3", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RandomNoise"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## LTX-2.5 导演台（官方 2.5 管线）\n\n导演台节点全部保留：`LTXDirector` / `LTXDirectorGuide` ×2 / `LTXDirectorCropGuides` ×2。\n采样部分改成 LTX-2.5 官方 i2v / t2v 的做法：\n\n| 环节 | 原来 (2.3 风格) | 现在 (2.5 官方) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Stage1 调度 | BasicScheduler linear_quadratic 8步 | ManualSigmas 固定 8 步 |\n| Stage2 调度 | BasicScheduler linear_quadratic 4步 denoise 0.42 | ManualSigmas 固定 3 步，从 0.85 起噪 |\n| 采样器 | euler | euler_ancestral |\n| Guider | CFGGuider(1) | LTXVDualCFGGuider(video 1 / audio 1) |\n| Stage2 噪声 | 与 Stage1 共用 seed | 独立固定 seed 42 |\n| 解码 | VAEDecode | VAEDecodeTiled 512/64/64/16 |\n\n**为什么效果会变好**：2.5 蒸馏模型的 sigma 表是 Lightricks 单独标定过的，\n`linear_quadratic` 是 2.3 时代的调度，步数对得上但噪声落点不对。\nStage2 从 0.85 起噪（而不是 0.42）也是官方给 2.5 上采样级定的，细节重建更多。\n\n**关于 Dual CFG**：video_cfg == audio_cfg 时它内部会退化成普通 CFG，\n所以 1/1 和原来的 CFGGuider(1) 完全等价——换上来是为了和官方一致，\n并且给你一个单独调音频引导强度的旋钮（想强化音频就把 audio_cfg 调到 1 以上）。\n\n**关于 LTX2_NAG（KJnodes）**：官方工作流没有这个节点，但**故意保留**了。\n因为 cfg=1 时负面提示词根本不起作用，NAG 是让你那条\n\"subtitles, captions, ...\" 反字幕负面提示生效的唯一途径。\n想完全对齐官方就把两个 LTX2_NAG 设为 Bypass（Ctrl+B），模型会原样透传。\n\n**没有搬过来的**：官方的 `ResolutionSelector` 和 `TextGenerateLTX2Prompt` 提示词增强器。\n前者的活由 `LTXDirector` 自己的宽高 / 32 对齐 + `LTXDirectorGuide` 的 scale_by 0.5 干了\n（这本来就等价于官方\"一阶段半分辨率、二阶段 x2 上采样\"）；\n后者会和导演台的分段提示词打架。\n\n**唯一一处有意偏离官方**：Stage #1 的种子保持 `0 / fixed`（官方是 randomize）。\n导演台是按时间轴分段调的，固定种子才能\"改一段、其余画面不变\"。\n想完全随机就把 `Stage #1 Noise` 的 control 改成 randomize。\nStage #2 的种子已按官方改成固定 42。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "说明 / 改动清单", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [640, 760], "pos": [6440, 160], "id": 143, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [1098], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [520, 180], "pos": [7337.6611328125, 146.31277465820312], "widgets_values": ["smiling, smile, grin, grinning, laughing, happy expression, cheerful expression, raised cheeks, smiling eyes, joyful, subtitles, captions, on-screen text, text overlay, watermark, logo, UI, garbled text, speech bubble, credits"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1108, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 136, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.64", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order"